---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Now"
  description="What René Galindo is doing now"
  footerText="Updated: July 2026"
>
  <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      Updated July 17, 2026 from Mexico City.
    </p>

    <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
      <li>
        Running away from Barcelona's <a
          href="https://www.elperiodico.com/es/sociedad/20260708/barcelona-record-absoluto-temperatura-40-grados-miercoles-calor-132256633"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >record-breaking</a> heat. Staying in an Airbnb in CDMX.
        Enjoying the rain every afternoon - feels like a climate shelter here.
      </li>
      <li>
        Taking a break after an intense 0 to 1 project with <a
          href="https://getaxyom.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >Axyom</a>. Focusing on
        adding table-stakes features to <a
          href="https://blank.page/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >blank.page</a>
        such as projects (aka folders), typeface options, and more.
      </li>
      <li>
        Also working on my new personal/professional site (this site!). I moved my
        short-form blog (in Spanish) over to <a
          class="rainbow-link"
          href="https://shuffle.renegalindo.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >shuffle.renegalindo.com</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        Eating multiple mangos a day - likely what I miss the most about living
        here.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
